e-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡，请进入小程序选购哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 253px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
